amulet of life saving *could* have been used to get gray dragon scale mail. 
You said you had 7 amulets at one point, but the wiz's touch of death toasted 
3 of them - I'm assuming that at least one of your 7 came from a WOW, although 
if you poly-pile'd them, maybe not. If you got all the way to the wiz, 
however, it's almost certain that you used at least one wish.

If you do wish for gray dragon scale mail, however, be *very* careful about 
your spelling. The denizens of wish-level are spelling-bee graduates and 
nit-picky as hell (so to speak)... :-)

